    "No accounts, analytics, tracking, purchases or advertising. Your collection stays on this device and its widget group. Deleting the app removes local progress; system backups follow your device settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keine Konten, Analysen, Nachverfolgung, Käufe oder Werbung. Deine Sammlung bleibt auf diesem Gerät und in seiner Widget-Gruppe. Beim Löschen der App geht lokaler Fortschritt verloren; Systemsicherungen folgen den Geräteeinstellungen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No accounts, analytics, tracking, purchases or advertising. Your collection stays on this device and its widget group. Deleting the app removes local progress; system backups follow your device settings."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sans compte, analyse, suivi, achat ni publicité. Votre collection reste sur cet appareil et son groupe de widgets. Supprimer l’app efface la progression locale ; les sauvegardes suivent les réglages de l’appareil."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sem contas, análise, rastreamento, compras ou anúncios. Sua coleção fica neste aparelho e no grupo de widgets. Excluir o app remove o progresso local; os backups seguem os ajustes do aparelho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
